WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:19.160
Oh yeah!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.040
I'm officially one of Raimon's soccer club members starting from today!

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.500
All right!

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.110
That'll be all for today's class.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:13.520
Stand!

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:15.380
Bow!

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:19.750
Shinsuke, let's hurry and get going!

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:20.290
Yeah!

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:24.460
Wait for me!

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:25.790
Tenma! Shinsuke!

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.830
I said to wait!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:33.340
Excuse us!

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.470
No one's here yet.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.100
This is our club room from now on...

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.600
Oh, you're early.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:46.490
Senpai, hello!

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:52.480
Um, if you have something for us to do before practice, please let us know!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.670
I'll do whatever I can!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.570
Captain!

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.010
Good to be on the team!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.150
Yeah.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.490
Let's have the new members introduce themselves.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.650
Okay.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.320
You're up first.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.410
Go, Tenma.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.500
Tell 'em good!

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.290
Who are you?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:12.980
Me?

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.340
Are you interested in joining as a manager?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:18.530
I don't do anything I find bothersome.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.140
Hmm, how do I explain this?

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.380
I think I'll be this guy's private cheer squad.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.780
Private cheer squad?

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.010
Oh, but you don't have to worry about any trouble from me.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:29.980
C'mon.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.360
I'm Matsukaze Tenma, a first-year!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.700
Um, uh...

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.740
Tenma.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.080
Calm down.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:49.860
Okay...

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.120
Anyway, I really like soccer, so I'm glad to be here!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.500
Yeah, good to have you.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:58.400
Okay!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.440
Thanks.

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:00.320
Next.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.130
Okay!

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.880
Nishizono Shinsuke, a first-year.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.300
I was a defender in elementary school.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.390
I'll do my best, so I hope we have a good year!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.260
What?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:13.520
No, nothing...

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.130
Next.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.730
Hey, you're up!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.610
Can't you hear?

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.740
Tsurugi Kyousuke.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.550
We're done for, with someone like that on the team...

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.790
He's really here to tear us down, isn't he.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.870
Isn't he?

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.090
It's all over...

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.530
Next up are the managers!

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.330
Okay!

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:45.230
I'm Sorano Aoi, a first-year.

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:46.720
I hope we have a good year!

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.800
Yamana Akane, a second-year.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.960
Then for the record...

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.600
Seto Midori, a second-year.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.400
Good to be here.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.860
All right, it's our turn next.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.450
The third-years are the goalkeeper, Sangoku-senpai,

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.820
Minamisawa-senpai,

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:09.910
Kurumada-senpai,

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.090
and Amagi-senpai.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:14.120
Nice to meet you.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.620
Nice to meet you!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.310
The rest are second-years...

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:20.780
Kurama.

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:21.820
Kirino.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:22.860
Hayami.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:23.960
Hamano.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.930
I'm the captain, Shindou.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.050
And I'm the soccer club's counselor, Otonashi Haruna.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:32.760
This is Coach Kudou.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.290
It's nice to meet you!

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.270
And now, here are your uniforms.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.360
Aren't these uniforms for the first team?

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.450
Normally, you'd start from the second team...

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.960
But since so many people quit after the incident earlier...

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.350
Is this really okay?

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.200
This doesn't mean you're officially on the first team yet.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.300
Okay, I'll do my best!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.710
The first team's uniform...

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:08.090
This might be a bit big for me.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.550
Come to practice as soon as you change.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:12.800
Okay!

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:16.930
Here it comes, Hamano!

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:18.520
Kay-O!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.290
So this is the first team.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:28.030
They're so fast, it's so awesome!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.450
What're you doing, Tenma?

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.010
Get moving!

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:35.410
Someone unexpected has really taken a liking to Tenma.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:40.180
Can I really bring the soccer club back on its feet?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.130
Shindou!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.520
I know what you're feeling.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.840
But we just have to accept it for now!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.140
Shindou!

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:59.430
Okay, bring it, Minamisawa!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.400
Sonic Shot!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:20.280
Burning Catch!

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:27.950
He blocked it.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.030
Hamano!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.570
So those are Raimon's hissatsu techniques...

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:36.760
Minamisawa-senpai's shoot was amazing, but to be able to block that shoot is even more impressive!

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.570
Matsukaze!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:39.330
Finally!

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.160
Don't dawdle around!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.600
Okay!

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.810
Almost had it.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.440
Hamano, do a better job with your passes!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:52.450
Why did Coach let this guy join?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:02.910
They really are at a high level.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:05.460
Did you see Kurumada-senpai's defense?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.420
Yeah!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:10.340
But Hamano-senpai's dodges were something too.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.360
When two of them were going after him,

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.840
he just went "whoosh" and passed them both!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:18.190
This isn't the time to be impressed about them.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.480
Neither of you even got to touch the ball much in the end.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:27.130
Don't come crying to me if your first team uniforms get taken away soon.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.300
I wonder if they'll really take it away.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.160
Because we aren't good enough yet...

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.180
It's all right!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:40.280
As long as you work hard, it'll work out!

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:46.950
That's right.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.670
We'll just do what we can tomorrow!

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:50.470
Yeah!

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:52.760
Kudou-kun.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:57.400
We've arranged a practice match for next Sunday.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.800
The opponent will be Eito Academy.

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:04.430
And Fifth Sector has submitted an order for the final score.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.310
So what is it this time?

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:09.950
3-0, Raimon's loss.

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:12.920
Got it?

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:16.150
You know what happens if you go against the rules.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:19.660
Avoid any objectionable behavior if you would.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.920
Is that all you wanted to discuss with me?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:23.810
Yeah.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.680
Then I'll excuse myself.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.310
Will it really be all right?

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.050
Do the usual.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.870
Yes, sir. At once!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:42.010
That Kudou-kun is such a sore to work with.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.600
Yes, looking good.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.810
Yes! All right! Just a bit more...

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.690
Got it!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:55.580
Okay, if I just clear this, then I can head straight into the castle...

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.590
Who the heck is that?!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:00.580
Yes?

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:03.120
Coach Kudou.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.720
We've got a practice match with Eito Academy.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.670
The score order is 3-0, Raimon's loss.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.600
So it's happening.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:13.380
Are the preparations moving along?

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.520
Yes, sir.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.630
All right, keep it up.

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:19.020
It's finally coming.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.730
Hey, you can't do that to me!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.850
Coach, this was at Shindou's place yesterday.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:34.190
Eito Academy                  Raimon Jr. High

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:38.340
Coach, is it a loss this time?

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.800
It's a loss...

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.710
Why of all schools does it have to be Eito?!

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:46.490
We could take down a school like theirs in one hit if we wanted to!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.630
All right, we'll be first today too!

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:55.130
Good... morning.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.400
What's going on?

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.590
We've got a practice match with Eito Academy.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.840
Eito Academy?

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:08.400
That's the school that's been getting attention for getting stronger lately, isn't it?{}

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.840
Really?

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:10.750
Yeah!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:16.190
It was famous for being a seminary school at first,
but their soccer has been getting strong lately too!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.690
Thanks to Fifth Sector...

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.250
Eito Academy, huh.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.300
Senpai, let's do our best!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.460
I'll cheer you on with everything I've got!

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:27.590
Cheer them on?

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.320
You guys will be playing too.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.470
We will?

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.840
Otherwise we don't have enough players.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.420
Oh, right.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.010
I look forward to it!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:42.160
I'll do all I can, so let's win this one!

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:45.140
A match, huh? I can't wait for it!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:45.710
Yeah!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:48.960
Okay! Time to get fired up and practice!

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.790
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.500
GO!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.830
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.120
Shindou-san.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:14.540
Excuse me, you're Raimon soccer club's captain, Shindou-san, right?

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.040
Yes...

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.900
I knew it!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.620
Hayato!

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:22.970
This is my son, Hitofude Hayato.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:26.400
He's a midfielder at Eito Academy's soccer club.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.050
Eito Academy?

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:33.360
But he never gets a chance to make shoots, so it's not looking good for his student record.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.940
Of course, I've already talked to our coach about it.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.730
But he doesn't seem to be very responsive.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.270
So what I had in mind is this...

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.850
They're concert tickets.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.410
Please take them.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:50.390
I heard your family likes classical music quite a bit.{conductor no riyuu}

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.910
Just one point is enough.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.270
One point.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.950
Come now, Hayato, you ask him too.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.340
Um, but I can't...

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.650
It's fine!

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.850
I just happened to have extras.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.770
I'll be counting on you.

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.880
Hayato, don't fall behind. Come quickly!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:29.910
He's late. It's almost dinnertime.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.930
2, 3, 1, 3, 2...

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:38.290
2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 3...

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.080
There he is. I knew it!

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:41.020
3, 3, 1...

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.920
3, 3, 3...

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.390
Thanks, Sasuke.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.140
Was 3-3-3 too much?

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.830
No, it shouldn't be.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:03.440
As long as I practice, I'll definitely be able to do it!

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:07.300
1, 2, 1, 3...

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.410
1, 2, 3...

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.120
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.140
Watch out!

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:24.930
Oww...

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.390
What's with that face?

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.440
It's full of scratches!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:38.140
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:42.080
Aki-nee just made a big fuss and put all these on. I'm fine!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.050
Ow!

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.190
Yep, looks fine.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:48.110
Yes.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.610
You were practicing at the riverbank again, weren't you.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:56.630
But I kept thinking about how I shouldn't be a burden to the upperclassmen today,

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:59.000
so I just had to do something about it.

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.350
So you kept practicing until your face got like that?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.890
You really are a hard worker, Tenma!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.210
We're going in this?

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.660
Yes, this is our transportation bus.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.760
It's so cool!

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.270
Now get on, everyone!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.330
Okay!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.340
Tenma!

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:20.280
What?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.890
Sorry about that!

00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:24.450
Please go ahead.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.380
It really feels like we're going to have a match now.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:33.200
Tenma, aren't you nervous?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.500
I am!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:39.510
It feels hot all over, and my heart's pumping like heck!

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:43.450
Isn't that more like you're just excited for a chance to play soccer?

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.690
It's fine to be just a little more nervous.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.930
I said I am, though!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.320
Now, now...

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.960
Aren't you going to tell them about the order?

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:56.720
They'll figure it out from the match whether I tell them or not.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.250
Just what you'd expect from Eito Academy.

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:07.670
Their new popularity is bringing in so many people to the stands.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.090
We're playing a match with all these people around...

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:11.250
Tenma.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.120
That's how it feels to be nervous.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.950
Okay, I'll do my best!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.660
Saewatari.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:22.600
Yes, Coach?

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.880
The first half is two goals with Yukiji.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.960
What about Kindaichi?

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:31.070
Kindaichi had a goal in the previous match.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.170
He's not scoring today.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.010
Understood.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.730
Just watch.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:40.200
Not everything will go your way just because you're the coach.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:46.450
Hayato, do your best out there!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.530
This is the moment you've been waiting for!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:54.210
Wherever Raimon's soccer club goes, Kakuma Ayumu will be there!

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:56.630
Currently winning consecutive victories at full speed,

00:16:56.630 --> 00:17:01.450
I, Kakuma Ayumu, will be commentating for this match against Eito Academy as they ride on this wave of momentum!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:02.900
Let's go.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:03.590
Okay!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.800
Tenma, Shinsuke, good luck!

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.330
Win at all costs!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:11.360
Both teams are in position.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.850
Raimon Jr. High has a new midfielder, Matsukaze Tenma,

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.460
along with a new defender, Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:20.910
What kind of plays will they show us?

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.020
Calm down, calm down!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.850
I did all that practice, so it should be all right!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:30.440
The first half has now started with Raimon's kickoff!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:32.360
Shindou!

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:35.450
Hamano!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.390
Minamisawa-san!

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:41.010
Raimon quickly connects their passes as they head up!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.280
I need to keep up with them!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.690
Holy Emperor.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:50.290
The match between Raimon Jr. High and Eito Academy has begun.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.010
Minamisawa heads up!

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.930
You're not getting past me!

00:17:57.170 --> 00:18:00.010
Minamisawa dodges a charge from Eito Academy!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.100
Minamisawa-senpai is impressive as always.

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:07.950
How about we keep it even for the first five minutes?

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:10.730
We've gotta keep the stands entertained.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.970
Are they going to make it in like this?

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:14.230
All right, this looks good!

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.580
Thief Eye!

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:34.120
The ball is stolen from Minamisawa!

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:35.660
Thanks.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.330
Kakizaki.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.430
Defense hissatsu technique x1.

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:49.420
I can't believe they got the ball from Minamisawa-senpai like that.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.330
This is Eito Academy...

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:53.310
I've gotta do what I can too!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.890
This is amazing! It's a harsh clashing of power!

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:03.170
Both teams are facing a completely even battle!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:07.820
Oh, the pass to Kurama has connected!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.830
Will Kurama make it past the others?

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:11.490
Kurama-senpai!

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.710
The ball's been stolen!

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:16.900
Good work, Fukuro!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:22.300
They think they're so good when they're just waiting for the moments when we hold back...

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.390
Nice act there.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.390
That was close!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:28.780
Tenma!

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:30.820
You can't get the ball when you're over there!

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:31.690
Go up more!

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.730
It's no use, I can't keep up with their speed!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:37.620
The unified attack and defense continue!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:42.760
It's about time we got a point now.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.660
#7 will make an assist and #9 will score it in.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.080
Hamano!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:59.290
All right, it's Captain!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.720
They got the ball from Captain?

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:08.060
#7 from Eito Academy, Fukuro, makes a nice cut!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.460
Yukiji!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:12.940
Oh no!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.250
Perfect Course!

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:28.250
It'll be okay, Senpai will be able to stop that one.

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:39.990
Burning Catch!

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:51.380
Goal!

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.060
Eito Academy gets the first point!

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.980
Senpai's hissatsu technique was broken past?

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.710
I know there's a score order.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:11.790
But even so, why do I have to let a shoot like that get into the goal?!

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:13.550
Sangoku...

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.700
Sangoku-san...

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:25.360
This is Raimon...

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:27.090
Tsurugi! Let's have a card game battle!

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:28.800
Sure.

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:31.750
I'll level up by connecting this bond.

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:35.640
Take this!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.410
Death Sword!

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.270
Sangoku-senpai, I'm counting on you!

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:42.210
Burning Catch!

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:44.340
I'll be the one to win!

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:46.070
Burning Chance!

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:50.400
All right! Nice catch!

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.910
Inazuma Eleven GO Trading Card Game!

00:23:52.910 --> 00:24:07.880
Next Episode

00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:56.410
Captain, I don't want a match like this!

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:59.420
Raimon's going to win! No matter what!

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:03.650
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Feelings Packed Into the Last Pass

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:05.370
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:07.880
<b>The Feelings Packed Into the Last Pass</b>

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:17.890
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:24:23.430 --> 00:24:27.060
As long as I practice, I'll definitely be able to do it!

00:24:27.060 --> 00:24:27.870
That's all!
